       For some buildings with strong cultural, historical, economic or human values that are
        denied coverage by insurance companies, a third mathematical model is developed to
        assess the value of the buildings and provide developers and building managers with




                                                                      型
        recommendations for building preservation. This culminates in a letter of
        recommendation to the community with plans, timelines, and cost proposals for the




                                                            模
        future of their treasured landmark building.

