8 Model Evaluation and Further Discussion
                          号




8.1 Strengths
                  信




     1) Our model uses the latest databases from official websites and official journals to collect
        more than 200 data for each indicator, and the results of the study have a high reference
          微




        value and can be applied to real life.
     2) The MDI model we built in Task 1 quantifies the impact of meteorological disasters,
        which allows the results of the model to be visualized with high precision. The
        evaluation indicators were selected with reference to numerous literature works, and
        the selected factors are objective and characteristic.
                                                                                                   2
                                                                                                         关注数学模型
                                                                                          MATHmodels


